# --- Review workbooks: generated, and they carry verbatim paper prose ---
# sfn_review*.xlsx are per-pass review spreadsheets regenerated from stored results. They hold
# extracted values alongside the quotes those values came from, including quotes from the papers
# held out by prereg C11/C26. This repository is PUBLIC, and GitHub push protection only catches
# credentials -- it would not stop a workbook full of third-party prose. They were untracked but
# not ignored, i.e. one `git add -A` from publication; the explicit-pathspec habit was the only
# thing holding them back. Now it is structural.
# The LABEL workbooks under ground_truth/ are deliberately tracked and are a different thing:
# they are the labelling instrument and the source of truth the scored csv derives from.
extractor_mvp/sfn_review*.xlsx
